━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
+ Narrowed is Tuple

` What is known of a key from some point on. `assigned` says an assignment left it so, and
` no condition: it holds where the region it was made in ends, as far as that region ran.

+ key NarrowingKey
+ type TypeId
+ cases U64
+ assigned Bool

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
+ TypedSite is Tuple

+ type TypeId
+ syntax SyntaxId

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
+ Outgoing is Tuple

` An error on its way out of a function, at the syntax that lets it out. A call whose callee
` has not settled its errors holds their place instead: it names the callee and the fact of the
` call, and counts the function's transformers declared before it.
+ type TypeId
+ syntax SyntaxId
+ callee U32 = U32.max
+ call U32 = U32.max
+ transforms U32

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
+ OperatorQuery is Tuple
    is Hashable

` What a module asks when it asks whether a type declares an operator: the type, the
` operator's name, and the types of its arguments, the second none for one that takes one.

+ caller U32
+ receiver U32
+ name Atom
+ arg U32
+ second U32

────────────────────
+ this == other This

same-receiver && name == other.name && arg == other.arg && second == other.second

.. same-receiver = caller == other.caller && receiver == other.receiver

────────────────────
+ do get hash Hash

. fingerprint = (2166136261 /xor/ caller) * 16777619
fingerprint = (fingerprint /xor/ receiver) * 16777619
fingerprint = (fingerprint /xor/ arg) * 16777619
fingerprint = (fingerprint /xor/ second) * 16777619
= hash-for(name) /xor/ hash-for(fingerprint)

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
+ TypingScratch
    is Usable'Void

` The working stacks of the type pass. Each is a Scratch whose finished runs become read-only
` spans: a call's argument types, a hit's slot fills and relations, a signature's parameter
` names. Runs are marked, pushed, sliced, and rewound in LIFO order; a span taken over a finished
` run stays valid for the compile because the arena never reuses storage before release.
` A narrowing is found by its key: `latest` holds the place of the last one pushed for each
` key, and `links` the place of the one each narrowing followed. `using-types` holds the type
` each `using` of a class or a style sheet names, by its module and syntax, once one is found.
` `visible-styles` holds, by class or style sheet, the place and count in `visible-style-list`
` of the styles it sees, once each of its usings is found, and whether it has any.
` `missing-styles` holds, by class and interface, the first style the interface uses that the
` class does not, or no type, once it is found (`Checker.conform-styles`). `missing-members`
` holds, by type and interface, the module and declaration of the first function the interface
` requires that the type does not answer, or 0, once it is found (`Checker.conform-members`).
` `operators` holds whether a type declares an operator a module asks it for
` (`Calls.has-operator`). `rankings` holds what ranking chose for calls ranked before
` (`Ranking.recall`).
` `nested-unshared` and `inline-runs` hold, for the instances being typed, what the instances typed
` in turn changed that another pass cannot take in, and those typed only in another's run
` (`Checker.run`); `nested-unretirable` holds what they changed that retiring them cannot undo.

+ arena Arena
+ types Scratch'TypeId
+ names Scratch'Atom
+ words Scratch'U32
+ relations Scratch'Relation
+ call-arguments Scratch'CallArgument
+ syntax Scratch'SyntaxId
+ narrowings Scratch'Narrowed
_ links Scratch'U32
_ latest Map'NarrowingKey'U32'ArenaBacking
+ returns Scratch'TypedSite
+ yields Scratch'TypedSite
+ outgoing Scratch'Outgoing
+ slots Scratch'TypeId
+ signatures SignatureCache
+ rankings RankingCache
+ using-types Map'Size'U32'ArenaBacking
+ visible-styles Map'U32'U64'ArenaBacking
+ visible-style-list List'TypeId'ArenaBacking
+ missing-styles Map'U64'U32'ArenaBacking
+ missing-members Map'U64'U64'ArenaBacking
+ operators Map'OperatorQuery'Bool'ArenaBacking
+ runners [Runner]
+ nested-unshared I64
+ nested-unretirable I64
+ inline-runs [U32]
+ running [U32]
+ idle [IdleKit]
+ no-types ImmutableArray'TypeId'ArenaBacking
+ no-names ImmutableArray'Atom'ArenaBacking
+ no-fills ImmutableArray'U32'ArenaBacking
+ no-relations ImmutableArray'Relation'ArenaBacking
+ no-shapes ImmutableArray'CallArgument'ArenaBacking
+ no-syntax ImmutableArray'SyntaxId'ArenaBacking

────────────────────
+ This

.. types = Scratch'TypeId(arena, 1024)
.. names = Scratch'Atom(arena, 256)
.. words = Scratch'U32(arena, 512)
.. relations = Scratch'Relation(arena, 256)
.. call-arguments = Scratch'CallArgument(arena, 256)
.. syntax = Scratch'SyntaxId(arena, 256)
.. narrowings = Scratch'Narrowed(arena, 256)
.. links = Scratch'U32(arena, 256)
.. latest = Map'NarrowingKey'U32(arena)
.. returns = Scratch'TypedSite(arena, 256)
.. yields = Scratch'TypedSite(arena, 64)
.. outgoing = Scratch'Outgoing(arena, 256)
.. slots = Scratch'TypeId(arena, 256)
.. signatures = SignatureCache(arena)
.. rankings = RankingCache(arena)
.. using-types = Map'Size'U32(arena)
.. visible-styles = Map'U32'U64(arena)
.. visible-style-list = List'TypeId(arena)
.. missing-styles = Map'U64'U32(arena)
.. missing-members = Map'U64'U64(arena)
.. operators = Map'OperatorQuery'Bool(arena)
.. no-types = types.since(0)
.. no-names = names.since(0)
.. no-fills = words.since(0)
.. no-relations = relations.since(0)
.. no-shapes = call-arguments.since(0)
.. no-syntax = syntax.since(0)

────────────────────
+ begin-using

this

────────────────────
+ do end-using

release()

────────────────────
+ do release

signatures.release()
rankings.release()
arena.release()

────────────────────
+ do push-narrowing
    - narrowed Narrowed

` Pushes a narrowing, which becomes the latest of its key.
. position U32 = narrowings.length as U32
links.push(latest[narrowed.key] ?? U32.max)
latest[narrowed.key] = position
narrowings.push(narrowed)

────────────────────
+ do rewind-narrowings
    - mark ScratchMark

` Takes back the narrowings pushed since a mark. Each key's latest is again the one the
` narrowing taken back followed.
. position = narrowings.length
while position > mark
    position -= 1
    latest[narrowings[position].key] = links[position]
narrowings.rewind(mark)
links.rewind(mark)

────────────────────
+ do assigned-since [Narrowed]
    - mark ScratchMark

` What each key an assignment settled since a mark is narrowed to now: the latest narrowing
` of each, in the order the keys were last settled, latest first.
. found [Narrowed]
. position = narrowings.length
while position > mark
    position -= 1
    . row = narrowings[position]
    if !row.assigned
        continue
    . seen = false
    for known in found
        if known.key == row.key
            seen = true
    if !seen
        . now = narrowings[latest[row.key] ?? position]
        found += Narrowed(now.key, now.type, now.cases, true)
= found

────────────────────
+ narrowed-since TypeId
    - start ScratchMark
    - key NarrowingKey

` The most recent narrowing of a slot pushed since the mark, or no type.
|? position == U32.max || position < start
    no-type
??
    narrowings[position].type

.. position = latest[key] ?? U32.max

────────────────────
+ was-assigned Bool
    - start ScratchMark
    - key NarrowingKey

` Whether the most recent narrowing of a slot pushed since the mark is what an assignment
` left it as.
|? position == U32.max || position < start
    false
??
    narrowings[position].assigned

.. position = latest[key] ?? U32.max

────────────────────
+ narrowed-cases-since U64
    - start ScratchMark
    - key NarrowingKey

` The cases the most recent narrowing of a slot leaves its union, as a mask, or none.
|? position == U32.max || position < start
    0
??
    narrowings[position].cases

.. position = latest[key] ?? U32.max
